    · exact carry_not_r L hn _ ci (List.mem_of_mem_drop h)
    · exact carry_drop4_neF L hw hn _ h i (by omega) rfl
    · exact carry_index_ne L hw hn i 3 (by omega) (by decide) (by omega) h
